[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631730085","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102359#issuecomment-2631730085","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102359","id":2631730085,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c3QOl","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-03T18:16:24Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T18:16:24Z","body":"In this case overflow is caused by 2d editor tools (https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/7156).\nBut there are many other places that could cause overflow. Part of them listed here https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102301 (not proper fix, unfortunately).\nAlso there are situations when top editor toolbar (from `Scene` to update spinner) will be the source of overflow.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631730085/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631767040","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102359#issuecomment-2631767040","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102359","id":2631767040,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c3ZQA","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-03T18:34:52Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T18:35:48Z","body":"It's strange that the docks aren't reducing in size in the video you posted, since they should be able to narrower than that. With minimum-width docks, there should be no overflow (maybe a few pixels).\n\nWe should avoid making the minimum window size too high because of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/36373. If anything, we should strive to make it smaller by making things automatically collapse when the window is too small.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631767040/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631782040","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102359#issuecomment-2631782040","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102359","id":2631782040,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6c3c6Y","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-03T18:42:30Z","updated_at":"2025-02-03T18:42:41Z","body":"It's not about overflow, but more that the window can't fit to content properly. Either minimum window size is hard-coded and ignores content or size calculation is wrong.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631782040/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2631787168","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102359#issuecomment-2631787168","issue_url":"https://api.github.co